{"path":"/2025/12/metropolito-senolio-emanuelio-vizitas.html","kind":"article","title":"Metropolito senolio Emanuelio vizitas Lietuvoje","description":"Šiandien Lietuvoje lankėsi Chalkedono senolis metropolitas Emanuelis – Konstantinopolio patriarchato hierarchas, atsakingas už tarptautinius...","published":"2025-12-19T19:52:00+02:00","section":"Naujienos","labels":["Lietuva","naujienos"],"hero":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjjSpGT7bScT4vVTDAZJXwdJv4vVjgOdZhIleh6gAAWpq8dWQxdXatGGJxG-V3Ex3SnKzOUjaJXzlutxo8SzYVzTLGRa97jK5-xa49IbjazS0um0uFZ43QK87VAoUNBTOaK3aO_09UmC9F1PJYRwoyzb68y6FRzy-uuwVw_wskSYuC9H4ZBhOYbM1oV0lA/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/IMG_0756.jpeg","html":"<p><br></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjjSpGT7bScT4vVTDAZJXwdJv4vVjgOdZhIleh6gAAWpq8dWQxdXatGGJxG-V3Ex3SnKzOUjaJXzlutxo8SzYVzTLGRa97jK5-xa49IbjazS0um0uFZ43QK87VAoUNBTOaK3aO_09UmC9F1PJYRwoyzb68y6FRzy-uuwVw_wskSYuC9H4ZBhOYbM1oV0lA/s3000/IMG_0756.jpeg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjjSpGT7bScT4vVTDAZJXwdJv4vVjgOdZhIleh6gAAWpq8dWQxdXatGGJxG-V3Ex3SnKzOUjaJXzlutxo8SzYVzTLGRa97jK5-xa49IbjazS0um0uFZ43QK87VAoUNBTOaK3aO_09UmC9F1PJYRwoyzb68y6FRzy-uuwVw_wskSYuC9H4ZBhOYbM1oV0lA/s320/IMG_0756.jpeg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCItbT7ETwcTH2eqlKXdtskci3tm09Pl-SbEsyXl0kWseTHuyCLcMTKxf9ZVYBZe-8sJQzKgkI5W-XjjHcsMa_qugirvypRusq-xEAXZE-nSWMK_wRPb-c5BYnPa5VE95gUGjhLd6_9hFhzpdZpwgcG9iRUx0EMnDxAP7-uyevgB_-ncZGYCuyy_dApGQ/s2280/EdR0_e3BxMU.jpg__2280x1520_q85_ALIAS-newshudge_crop-smart_subsampling-2_upscale.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCItbT7ETwcTH2eqlKXdtskci3tm09Pl-SbEsyXl0kWseTHuyCLcMTKxf9ZVYBZe-8sJQzKgkI5W-XjjHcsMa_qugirvypRusq-xEAXZE-nSWMK_wRPb-c5BYnPa5VE95gUGjhLd6_9hFhzpdZpwgcG9iRUx0EMnDxAP7-uyevgB_-ncZGYCuyy_dApGQ/s320/EdR0_e3BxMU.jpg__2280x1520_q85_ALIAS-newshudge_crop-smart_subsampling-2_upscale.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><p>Šiandien Lietuvoje lankėsi Chalkedono senolis metropolitas Emanuelis – Konstantinopolio patriarchato hierarchas, atsakingas už tarptautinius ir ekumeninius ryšius. Vizito metu jis susitiko su Lietuvos Respublikos teisingumo ministre Rita Tamašuniene, užsienio reikalų ministru Kęstučiu Budriu, finansų viceministru Dariumi Sedecku, apaštališkuoju nuncijumi arkivyskupu Georgu Gänsweinu bei Lietuvos Vyskupų Konferencijos pirmininku, Vilniaus arkivyskupu metropolitu Gintaru Grušu.</p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhaVNO3ynFlMpLFjpb8MC9GjIav_z0M5F3UA4hS-Xcy7M2NMqzzYumWNvSCLNhiMGQkjYQwk23wEWKCIDEo6x9Ea3l7deZbmIunlYl-uhL69LbH972aVxp2MYlW96cYiWyDjrbZzzfjkdzJBgKF28AW_te7bz6M59-HOU0weI8QHeZdmfo9lx39YW71sYw/s4080/IMG_20251219_170025.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhaVNO3ynFlMpLFjpb8MC9GjIav_z0M5F3UA4hS-Xcy7M2NMqzzYumWNvSCLNhiMGQkjYQwk23wEWKCIDEo6x9Ea3l7deZbmIunlYl-uhL69LbH972aVxp2MYlW96cYiWyDjrbZzzfjkdzJBgKF28AW_te7bz6M59-HOU0weI8QHeZdmfo9lx39YW71sYw/s320/IMG_20251219_170025.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><p>Susitikimuose senolį metropolitą lydėjo laikinai einantis Lietuvos egzarcho pareigas kunigas Vitalijus Mockus ir kunigas Gintaras Jurgis Sungaila.</p><p>Susitikimų su Lietuvos valstybės atstovais metu senolis metropolitas Emanuelis padėkojo už Lietuvos institucijų dėmesį ir paramą atkuriant Konstantinopolio patriarchatui pavaldžią Ortodoksų Bažnyčią Lietuvoje. Taip pat buvo aptarti aktualūs Lietuvos egzarchato gyvenimo, religinės laisvės ir bendruomenės veiklos klausimai.</p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgtwTqXk3z_2zB8pOhK9tSIMU6ikwSm1Jq_URTDvd2kgevQojjE-oHjM7KqDr1_JckLlIvFdwdMX9UcqsSTNiV_Eozz8sy_7pTdSUToDr_VEGaQhuNUaNKDV5sqLx2Coa16M3JTPY96WhmUtI9UwZH77EYb_9xWJL6RbMLHjPXAi5UmRvhMlNHHgOt4aNE/s4080/1000050740.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgtwTqXk3z_2zB8pOhK9tSIMU6ikwSm1Jq_URTDvd2kgevQojjE-oHjM7KqDr1_JckLlIvFdwdMX9UcqsSTNiV_Eozz8sy_7pTdSUToDr_VEGaQhuNUaNKDV5sqLx2Coa16M3JTPY96WhmUtI9UwZH77EYb_9xWJL6RbMLHjPXAi5UmRvhMlNHHgOt4aNE/s320/1000050740.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiyzp7y3qWe2bZ8rxrzXgN6Zk0hX88ulYYL4ULX2-saFA5C4kYn_rNgpyucj3ijDJ-ZlatjJsjTIkN9_ykfy1x8k8mMd0TYrX3p5oR30Jq9OR7BKLoEtrtsIHfGEUF8JBLUkHHlaxGGdnmxGavTa97_tM2-uCxIDh-E_ugdRRdS2HInwWIUy3IpciIzKbQ/s4080/1000050735.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiyzp7y3qWe2bZ8rxrzXgN6Zk0hX88ulYYL4ULX2-saFA5C4kYn_rNgpyucj3ijDJ-ZlatjJsjTIkN9_ykfy1x8k8mMd0TYrX3p5oR30Jq9OR7BKLoEtrtsIHfGEUF8JBLUkHHlaxGGdnmxGavTa97_tM2-uCxIDh-E_ugdRRdS2HInwWIUy3IpciIzKbQ/s320/1000050735.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><p>Po susitikimų su valstybės ir Bažnyčios atstovais senolis metropolitas Emanuelis susitiko su Lietuvos egzarchato dvasininkija. Susitikimo metu buvo aptarti aktualūs Lietuvos krikščionių ortodoksų gyvenimo klausimai, taip pat perduotas Jo Šventenybės visuotinio patriarcho palaiminimas Lietuvos egzarchatui ir tikintiesiems.</p><p>Kunigai taip pat pasveikino metropolitą gimimo dienos proga.</p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEih3P4JJSVWwY1y2h5ArHYCuljWrbrrjzThOCOmVTEuEX-ge1EgktNM1g4FCE8N7E9ASW15aMsgV5gQp1MfGY3OYfiTAjiucC1o599Ihooq16AOrip1W5F1DvVa8nkgGRQeO14MdGJy6z347okpnBWqd2ERhGYyoZ2iFtXoEQceu-tnUEzg-OhLX0NxcGY/s4080/1766166434597_1000050727.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20251219231714im_/https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEih3P4JJSVWwY1y2h5ArHYCuljWrbrrjzThOCOmVTEuEX-ge1EgktNM1g4FCE8N7E9ASW15aMsgV5gQp1MfGY3OYfiTAjiucC1o599Ihooq16AOrip1W5F1DvVa8nkgGRQeO14MdGJy6z347okpnBWqd2ERhGYyoZ2iFtXoEQceu-tnUEzg-OhLX0NxcGY/s320/1766166434597_1000050727.jpg\" width=\"241\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><p><br></p>","capture":"20251219231714","source":"https://www.ortodoksas.lt/2025/12/metropolito-senolio-emanuelio-vizitas.html"}
